@startuml
[*] --> New User : Initial State
New User -->|Successful registration|> Registered User
Registered User -->|Valid sign-in credentials|> Signed In
Signed In -->|Failed registration|> Access Denied
Access Denied --> [*]
Signed In -->|Viewing a result|> Session Ended
Session Ended --> [*]
Signed In -->|Completing payment process|> Payment Processing
Payment Processing -->|Successful payment processing|> Service Completed
Service Completed --> [*]
@enduml
